    "description": "Welcome to Wheelie Life 3, the best online wheelie game of the moment.\r\nWith an individual and online mode, where you can join or create rooms to play with your friends and more players. It has a wide variety of maps and bikes, that you can upgrade and customize with different skins. Also you'll be able to customize your rider with different helmets, goggles and gloves.\r\nThe physics are improved, and the game is compatible with Gamepads.",
